  "id": "creative-arts-therapy",
  "term": "creative arts therapy",
  "definition": "Creative arts therapy is an arts-based intervention that uses creative activities and different media in a supportive setting to promote engagement, reflection, and learning. In the source, it is described as a person-centered approach in which participants have autonomy over their creative activity while creative therapists offer guidance as needed.",
